# NovelGuard project

## Layers (do not violate)

| Layer | May | Must not |
| ----- | --- | -------- |
| `domain` | Pure rules, VOs, policies | I/O, UI, DB, API |
| `application` | Use cases, DTOs, ports | Concrete infrastructure |
| `infrastructure` | FS, hashing, adapters | Business policy |
| `web` | React UI vs API/DTO contracts | Infrastructure internals |
| `app` | Composition, wiring | — |

Detail: [docs/current_architecture.md](mdc:docs/current_architecture.md).

## Product rules

- Preserve public function/class signatures unless the task requires a change.
- Do not edit unrelated files.
- Large or contract-changing work: read the spec/plan the job or user names under `docs/` before coding.
- New specs/plans under `docs/` (not legacy `documents/` for new work).

## UI

- Tailwind v4; tokens and patterns from [DESIGN.md](mdc:DESIGN.md).
- For `web/**` edits, attach `40-web-tailwind` when styling.
